    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27600" root="ظل" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظِلَالَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُلَّةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>A cloud that one sees
by itself, and of which one sees the shadow upon
the earth.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأَيْتُ ظِلَالَةً</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنَ الطَّيْرِ</span> i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيَابَةً</span> [app. meaning <i>I saw a
covert,</i> or <i>place of concealment, of birds</i>]. (TA.)

